# Possibility to select multiple discs for batch actions

Now it is possible to select multiple discs to send an sms to. In a similar fashion I'd like to select
multiple discs that I want to:
- mark as returned
- mark for sale/donation
- delete

In these new cases I want to the system to require a confirmation from me, before doing the selected action.
The confirmation message should state what is been trying to do and on how many discs. The disc data is
irrelevant in the confirmation text.


## Improvements

After I have added several discs, I often send messages to them. Some of the added discs don't have a
phone number so when I select multiple discs, I have to carefully select only those that have a
number. I'd like to have a button that selects all new discs that have a phone number.

What can be considered "new" are those, that have the same "added at" date (use day as accuracy) and
are the latest added discs.

Button label should be "Valitse uusimmat". Place the button above the disc result table.

Create a new branch for this.
